   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2024-11-01.bandcampbootlegger** (recommended): soundboard; 25 songs; 179 min [1]\n- **kglw2024-11-01**: source not stated; 25 songs; 180 min [2]. Said about its sound: The recording was transferred to a MacBook Pro and processed in Reaper to create a 24/48 flac file [2]\n- **kglw2024-11-01.THOR**: source not stated; 3 songs; 178 min [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Joey Walker played a microtonal acoustic guitar during the performance [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2024-11-01.bandcampbootlegger**: taped by Sam Joseph, Joe Santarpia, Grace Reader, Gaspard De Meulemeester; transferred by KGLW.net; source: SBD [1]\n- **kglw2024-11-01**: taped by Sean Simpson; transferred by Sean Simpson; source: Schoeps cmc1L/mk41v [2]. Also: Sean Simpson recorded and mastered the audio using a Schoeps mk41v and Sound Devices Mixpre6ii [2]\n- **kglw2024-11-01.THOR**: taped by puffanug; transferred by puffanug; source: ADK Thor> PMD661 > 24/96 wav [3]. Also: ADK T7 THORs captured the sound at the front of house using an ORTF cardioid pattern [3]",
